a copy of which is bundled in the package as `tools\LICENSE.txt`.

This is an unofficial, community-maintained package and is not affiliated with
or endorsed by the OpenBao project. Report packaging issues on the
[package source repository](https://github.com/jaxzin/choco-openbao/issues);
report issues with OpenBao itself on the
[OpenBao issue tracker](https://github.com/openbao/openbao/issues).
]]></description>
